assistantMessage.content:
Here is the TypeScript script to log to the console and broadcast to the in-game chat:

```typescript
import { host } from "host";

// Print to the sandbox console
console.log("Hello World");

// Broadcast to the in-game chat via the host bridge
const result = await host.chat.broadcast("Hello World");

if (result.accepted) {
  console.log(`Broadcast queued successfully (ID: ${result.commandId})`);
} else {
  console.error("Broadcast was not accepted by the host gateway.");
}
```

### Execution Note
To run this script, ensure you select the **`host-chat`** permission profile so the sandbox is authorized to call `host.chat.broadcast`.

